  "summary": "Multi-perspective academic paper review with dynamic reviewer personas. Runs a 5-seat, role-separated review panel (Journal-Fit Reviewer + 3 peer-review roles + Devil's Advocate) with field-specific expertise; role separation is not a claim of independent error processes. Supports full review, re-review (verification), quick assessment, methodology focus, Socratic guided, and calibration modes. Triggers on: review paper, peer review, manuscript review, referee report, review my paper, critique paper, simulate review, editorial review, calibrate reviewer, reviewer calibration, measure reviewer accuracy, \u5be9\u67e5\u8ad6\u6587, \u8ad6\u6587\u5be9\u67e5, \u6a21\u64ec\u5be9\u67e5, \u540c\u5115\u5be9\u67e5, \u5e6b\u6211\u5be9\u9019\u7bc7, \u4ee5\u5be9\u67e5\u4eba\u89d2\u5ea6\u8a55\u4f30, \u5be9\u67e5\u8005\u6821\u6e96, \ub17c\ubb38 \uc2ec\uc0ac, \ub3d9\ub8cc \uc2ec\uc0ac, \ubaa8\uc758 \uc2ec\uc0ac, \uc2ec\uc0ac\uc790 \uad00\uc810\uc5d0\uc11c \ud3c9\uac00, \uc2ec\uc0ac\uc790 \ubcf4\uc815.",
